window.__LITE_PARTS__=window.__LITE_PARTS__||[];window.__LITE_PARTS__.push([{"t":"非平衡量子湖模拟制备的捷径","b":"Author(s): Nik O. Gjonbalaj, Rahul Sahay, and Susanne F. YelinThe dynamical preparation of exotic many-body quantum states is a persistent goal of analog quantum simulation, often limited by experimental coherence times. Recently, it was shown that fast, nonadiabatic Hamiltonian parameter sweeps can create finite-size “lakes” of quantum order in certain settin…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 090802] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7bc2-6cgy","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子模拟","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"作者Nik O. Gjonbalaj、Rahul Sahay和Susanne F. Yelin研究新奇多体量子态的动力学制备，这是模拟量子模拟的持续目标，但常受实验相干时间限制。近期研究表明，快速非绝热哈密顿量参数扫描可在某些条件下创建有限尺寸的量子序‘湖’。该工作提出了制备这类非平衡量子湖的模拟捷径方法。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 090802（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["态制备方法[非平衡量子湖模拟]: 快速非绝热哈密顿参数扫描 shortcut 方法，突破实验相干时间限制"]},{"t":"利用 LUX-ZEPLIN (LZ) 实验寻找光暗物质和太阳中微子相干弹性中微子核散射的证据","b":"Author(s): D. S. Akerib et al. (LZ Collaboration)The LZ collaboration reports strong evidence (4.5σ) for coherent elastic scattering of 8B solar neutrinos.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091806] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/jvqf-njpj","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"暗物质探测","sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"LUX-ZEPLIN（LZ）合作组报告了8B太阳中微子相干弹性中微子-核散射的强有力证据，显著性达4.5σ。该结果同时用于寻找轻暗物质和太阳中微子信号。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091806（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["探测显著性[LZ实验CEvNS]: 4.5σ 8B太阳中微子相干弹性散射证据"]},{"t":"用 XENONnT 探测太阳 $^{8}\\mathrm{B}$ 中微子雾","b":"Author(s): E. Aprile et al. (XENON Collaboration)We report a $3.3σ$ measurement of coherent elastic neutrino-nucleus scattering from solar $^{8}\\mathrm{B}$ neutrinos using a $6.77\\text{ }\\text{ }\\mathrm{t}×\\mathrm{yr}$ exposure from the XENONnT experiment, inferring a solar $^{8}\\mathrm{B}$ neutrino flux of $({5}_{−2}^{+3})×{10}^{6}\\text{ }\\text{ …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091807] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/xvpn-w3q9","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中微子探测","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":8.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"XENON合作组利用XENONnT实验6.77吨·年的曝光量，报告了对太阳8B中微子相干弹性中微子-核散射的3.3σ测量，由此推断太阳8B中微子通量为约(5+3/−2)×10^6每平方厘米每秒量级。这是对太阳中微子雾现象的探测。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091807（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["探测显著性[XENONnT]: 3.3σ 8B太阳中微子CEvNS测量","曝光量[XENONnT]: 6.77 t·yr","中微子通量[太阳8B]: (5_{−2}^{+3})×10⁶ cm⁻²s⁻¹"]},{"t":"柯尔莫哥洛夫乘子的微扰反常指数","b":"Author(s): Alexei A. Mailybaev and Simon ThalabardA perturbative framework for anomalous scaling in turbulence, built on the statistics of Kolmogorov multipliers rather than correlation-function hierarchies, establishes a new analytical route to intermittency that complements traditional zero-mode methods.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 094002] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6qrr-3646","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"电荷有序 Kagome 金属中的应变调谐节点超导 ${\\mathrm{CsV}}_{3}{\\mathrm{Sb}}_{5}$","b":"Author(s): Yusuke Takeuchi, Akito Kobayashi, Saki Uchida, Takumi Nagao, Seigo Ogawa, Rui Zhou, Shinji Kawasaki, Fei Song, Hao Ni, Yong Zhao, and Guo-qing ZhengThe ground state of CsV3Sb5 is not a single superconducting state but two degenerate states.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096003] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mzgp-2lzb","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"连续体中反常无电荷束缚态的观察","b":"Author(s): Jue Li, Haoye Qin, Wenjing Lv, Yuzhi Shi, Bo Li, and Qinghua SongBound states in the continuum (BICs) are nonradiative modes embedded in the radiation continuum, offering powerful opportunities for wave manipulation in open systems. Although BICs themselves cannot be assigned a well-defined polarization state in the far field, the surrounding polarization field e…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096202] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/wylv-cc97","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"长冈铁磁体的不良金属行为和 Lifshitz 转变","b":"Author(s): Jonas Arnold, Peter Kopietz, and Andreas RückriegelUsing an extension of the fermionic functional renormalization group for systems where strong correlations give rise to projected Hilbert spaces, we calculate the phase diagram and the electronic spectral function of the Hubbard model at infinite on-site repulsion. For a square lattice with nearest-…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096506] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/py7g-jz2x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"全壳混合纳米线不存在准马约拉纳误报","b":"Author(s): Carlos Payá, César Robles, Pablo San-Jose, and Elsa PradaTunneling spectroscopy cannot be used as an unambiguous detection tool for Majorana zero modes (MZMs) in conventional partial-shell nanowires. The presence of smooth confinement at the end of the hybrid wire (among other sources of disorder) can create exponentially pinned zero-energy states, called…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096606] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/w9tp-3bbq","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"马约拉纳零模","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"作者Carlos Payá等人指出，隧穿谱学不能作为常规半壳纳米线中马约拉纳零模（MZMs）的明确检测工具。混合线末端的光滑限制（以及其他无序来源）会产生指数钉扎的零能态，称为准马约拉纳态，导致误报。该工作研究了全壳混合纳米线，表明其中不存在准马约拉纳误报问题。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096606（2026年8月28日）。"},{"t":"激活铁电聚合物中应力诱导的偶极子旋转","b":"Author(s): Cenling Huang, Feihong Du, Shengtao Zhu, Xiaoxu Wang, Yezhan Lin, Fang Wang, Xueqi Wang, Tiannan Yang, Xiaoshi Qian, and Xin ChenThe concept of morphotropic phase boundary has recently been employed to enhance the piezoelectric response in polymeric ferroelectrics, substantially improving the ${d}_{33}$ coefficient through engineered phase boundaries between $β$ and $3/1$-helical phases in polyvinylidene fluoride-based system…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096801] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/qcg4-y7br","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电聚合物","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"作者团队在聚偏氟乙烯基铁电聚合物体系中，利用同质异形相界概念，通过工程化β相与3/1螺旋相之间的相界大幅提升压电响应和d33系数。研究揭示了铁电聚合物中应力诱导的偶极子旋转机制，为高性能聚合物压电材料设计提供了新途径。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096801（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["压电增强机制[PVDF基铁电聚合物]: 通过β相与3/1螺旋相之间同质异晶相界工程提升d33系数","关键效应[铁电聚合物]: 应力诱导偶极子旋转"]},{"t":"固体圆二色性的完全最小耦合 GW-Bethe-Salpeter-方程框架：在手性二维钙钛矿中的应用","b":"Author(s): Xian Xu and Diana Y. QiuCircular dichroism (CD) and other chiroptical responses are key probes of both chirality and momentum-space geometry in solids, but first-principles calculations are still challenging in periodic systems with strong exciton effects. Here, we develop a gauge-invariant first-principles framework for C…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096901] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mdr9-tzws","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钙钛矿","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"圆二色性（CD）等手性光学响应是探测固体中手性和动量空间几何的关键手段，但在具有强激子效应的周期性体系中第一性原理计算仍具挑战性。作者Xian Xu和Diana Y. Qiu为固体圆二色性发展了完全最小耦合的规范不变第一性原理GW-Bethe-Salpeter方程框架，并将其应用于手性二维钙钛矿材料。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096901（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["计算框架[手性二维钙钛矿圆二色性]: 规范不变的第一性原理完全最小耦合GW-BSE框架"]},{"t":"来自守恒电荷涨落的重子夸克-双夸克结构的证据","b":"Author(s): Michał Marczenko and Krzysztof RedlichWe study fluctuations and correlations of conserved charges in QCD using a string-based description of the hadronic mass spectrum. Mesons and baryons are modeled as open relativistic strings with quark-antiquark and quark-diquark endpoints, respectively, leading to an exponential Hagedorn growth of …[Phys. Rev. C 114, 025205] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/yb26-gj61","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"飞秒镜和氘核形成中的相对论效应","b":"Author(s): Stanisław MrówczyńskiFor a long time, studies of femtoscopic correlations have provided information about space-time characteristics of particle sources in high-energy collisions. Recently, the correlation functions have also been used to determine interaction parameters of correlated particles, which is especially impo…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 025206] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/xp4n-hlr5","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"基于多尺度物理信息神经网络的真实车辆电池系统温度建模和预测","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926014054?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池温度","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出基于多尺度物理信息神经网络的方法，对真实车辆电池系统进行温度建模与预测。","kp":["温度建模方法[真实车辆电池系统]: 多尺度物理信息神经网络"]},{"t":"考虑时间分辨率的质子交换膜水电解槽动态电化学阻抗谱萃取方法","b":"Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) is an efficient in-operando characterization tool for analyzing the internal processes of proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWE). However, conventional EIS requires the system to operate under steady-state conditions, which limits its applicability in real-world systems. Dynamic EIS (DEIS) provides a potential approach to capture the variation of internal physical states caused by changes in operating conditions over time. However, existing impedance calculation methods, such as fast Fourier transform and wavelet transform-based approaches, are limited in their ability to analyse nonstationary signals across the entire frequency range. To address these limitations, this paper proposes a hybrid method that combines the advantages of several existing time–frequency and instantaneous feature extraction techniques to accurately obtain DEIS under dynamic conditions. This study segments the perturbation signals based on operating variations and applies adaptive processing to ensure accurate impedance extraction. Simulation and experimental verification under different input power profiles to a PEMWE are conducted in this work. The results demonstrate that the proposed hybrid method achieves a DEIS accuracy exceeding 96%, verifying its effectiveness for PEMWE applications and potential for other electrochemical devices.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013036?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解槽阻抗","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对质子交换膜水电解槽（PEMWE）的动态电化学阻抗谱（DEIS）提出一种新的萃取方法。传统EIS要求系统稳态运行，限制了实际应用；DEIS可捕捉运行条件变化引起的内部物理状态变化，但现有基于快速傅里叶变换和小波变换的阻抗计算方法在全频率范围内分析非平稳信号的能力有限。为此，论文提出一种结合多种方法优势的混合方法，兼顾时间分辨率，用于分析PEMWE内部过程。","kp":["[PEMWE动态阻抗谱]: DEIS可捕获运行条件变化引起的内部物理状态随时间变化，突破常规EIS需稳态条件的限制"]},{"t":"电池存储和变频空调机组的舒适感知大脑情感学习协调，用于微电网频率调节","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013796?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微网调频","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"利用电池储能和变频空调的舒适感知情感学习协调机制，实现微电网频率调节。","kp":["[微电网频率调节]: 电池储能与变频空调的舒适感知大脑情感学习协调机制"]},{"t":"使用参数高效的大语言模型进行推理增强的概率电价预测","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电价预测","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"采用参数高效微调的大语言模型结合推理增强，进行概率化电价预测。","kp":["[概率电价预测]: 参数高效微调的大语言模型结合推理增强"]},{"t":"不确定性下能源系统规划中基于多参数优化的决策方法","b":"Energy infrastructure planning confronts a fundamental temporal asymmetry in which capacity decisions must be committed before uncertainty materializes and yet must remain robust across all future operational scenarios. Traditional approaches either adopt worst-case hedging or ignore operational uncertainty. We address this through a Robust Optimization framework integrating data-driven uncertainty quantification with multiparametric programming, enabling design strategies as explicit functions of realized uncertainty without iterative re-optimization. We quantify forecasting errors via probabilistic deep learning technique to inform uncertainty bounds. Rather than worst-case designs, we model it as bilevel problem solved multiparametrically, deriving \"wait-and-see\" operations as piecewise affine functions of \"here-and-now\" decisions and uncertainty realizations.Applied to a multi-source, multi-sink energy system (wind, nuclear, natural gas, battery, electricity and hydrogen demands) under joint supply-demand uncertainty, the framework reveals a strategic shift in technology prioritization as uncertainty quantiles increase, optimal designs preferentially allocate capacity to expensive-but-reliable dispatchables even though economical renewables remain available. The complete parametric solution enables upfront cost-robustness trade-off exploration, providing a tractable and generalizable tool for risk-aware capacity expansion, supporting strategic investment decisions in uncertain and rapidly evolving energy landscape.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192601370X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源规划","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究针对能源基础设施规划中'容量决策须在不确定性显现前做出且需对未来所有运行情景保持稳健'的时间不对称难题，提出鲁棒优化框架，将数据驱动的不确定性量化与多参数规划相结合，使设计策略成为已实现不确定性的显式函数，无需迭代重新优化。研究利用概率深度学习技术量化预测误差以确定不确定性边界，将问题建模为双层优化并以多参数方法求解，推导出'等待观察'式的分段运行策略，避免了传统最坏情况对冲设计。","kp":["[不确定性下能源系统规划]: 鲁棒优化框架集成数据驱动不确定性量化与多参数规划，设计策略以显式函数形式表达"]},{"t":"通过综合预测和风险倾向，优化​​电力市场中光伏系统的风险意识竞价策略","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013838?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏竞价","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"通过综合预测和风险倾向分析，优化电力市场中光伏系统的风险感知竞价策略。","kp":["[光伏竞价策略]: 综合预测与风险倾向的风险感知竞价优化"]},{"t":"多利益相关者互动下考虑电动出租车车队影响的配电网协调运行","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013917?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配网运行","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究多利益相关者互动场景下，电动出租车车队对配电网协调运行的影响。","kp":["[配电网协调运行]: 多利益相关者互动下考虑电动出租车车队影响"]},{"t":"非线性热泵部分负荷效率建模以实现最佳投资规划","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013772?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热泵效率建模","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"建立热泵部分负荷非线性效率模型，用于能源系统投资规划优化。","kp":["[热泵投资规划]: 部分负荷非线性效率模型"]},{"t":"光伏发电斜坡预测的光谱间歇正则化","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926012821?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出光谱间歇正则化方法，提升光伏发电功率斜坡预测精度。","kp":["[光伏功率斜坡预测]: 光谱间歇正则化方法提升预测精度"]},{"t":"可再生能源的崛起：它如何塑造欧盟的依赖性、多样性和地缘政治风险","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526005045?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源地缘","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"分析可再生能源发展对欧盟能源依赖性、多样性及地缘政治风险的影响。"},{"t":"古地磁学的生活：丽莎·托克斯访谈","b":"Lisa introduced the field of paleomagnetism, shared several fascinating research stories, and recounted the challenges and setbacks, as well as the heartwarming moments, that she has experienced throughout her own scientific career.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag554/8774590?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"可扩展原子电子断层扫描的深度学习","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag561/8774596?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"原子断层扫描","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"开发深度学习方法，实现可扩展的原子电子断层扫描重建技术。","kp":["[原子电子断层扫描]: 深度学习实现可扩展的三维重建"]},{"t":"随着排放强度下降，全球稻米甲烷排放量在过去六年中增加了两倍","b":"Rice paddies are among the largest anthropogenic sources of methane (CH4), yet substantial uncertainties persist in the long-term magnitude and spatiotemporal dynamics of the emissions. Here we show a spatially explicit global estimate of rice CH4 emissions from 1961 to 2020, leveraging a new high-resolution dataset and two Tier 3 modeling approaches (process-based and machine-learning-based). We find that global emissions have more than tripled over the past six decades, reaching a record high of 38.8 Tg CH4 yr−1 in 2020 based on the mean of the two Tier 3 estimates, both the rate and magnitude are substantially higher than conventional emission-factor-based inventories. Traditional rice-producing regions (e.g. Asia) dominated the increase due to expanded cultivation and intensified organic inputs, while Africa emerged as a rapidly growing source. Beyond trends in absolute emissions, the CH4 emission intensity (per unit of rice yield) declined across 70% of the global paddy area, mainly reflecting yield-driven efficiency gains. Notably, 44% of global rice production in the 2010 s occurs in countries with below-average emission intensity, with China being the largest contributor. By resolving long-term spatial heterogeneity with new data and models, this study provides a robust reassessment of the global rice methane budget and highlights pathways to reconcile food production with climate mitigation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag555/8774597?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稻米甲烷排放","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":8.0,"d":9.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用新的高分辨率数据集和两种三级方法（基于过程模型和基于机器学习）对1961-2020年全球稻米甲烷排放进行了空间显性估算。结果显示全球排放在过去六十年中增长超过两倍，2020年达到创纪录的38.8 Tg CH4/年（两种三级估算的均值），其增速和总量均显著高于传统排放因子法清单。亚洲等传统稻米产区因种植面积扩大和有机集约化而主导了排放增长。","kp":["全球稻米甲烷排放量[1961-2020]: 过去六十年增长超过三倍，达历史新高"]},{"t":"前脑室下区成体神经干细胞胚胎起源的综合分析","b":"In the mammalian brain, adult neural stem cells (NSCs) located in ventricular-subventricular zone (V-SVZ) of lateral ventricles and dentate gyrus continuously generate new neurons and glia throughout life. The adult NSCs in V-SVZ are derived from ventricular radial glial cells (RGCs) which become quiescent during embryonic development. However, the origin and establishment of this adult NSC pool remain elusive, primarily due to the challenge of tracing the lineage from embryonic RGCs to their quiescent adult successors. Here, by leveraging Vcam1—a marker continuously expressed from embryonic RGCs to adult NSCs—we unravel the dynamic process and regulatory mechanism underlying the fate bifurcation that gives rise to quiescent seed cells. We demonstrate that Vcam1+ embryonic RGCs directly contribute to the adult NSC pool. A subpopulation of quiescent Vcam1+ RGCs emerges early and is maintained throughout development, while a parallel population of proliferative Vcam1+ progenitors actively replenishes this quiescent reservoir. Through the combinatory analysis of single-cell multi-omics and clonal lineage tracing of Vcam1+ cells, we identified the TGF-β/Smad3 pathway as a critical regulator of quiescence. Our work thus provides a mechanistic dissection of how the foundational adult NSC pool is established through precisely regulated fate decisions during embryogenesis, offering new insights into the principles of lifelong neurogenesis.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag516/8774603?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"超高分辨率量子点发光二极管","b":"Next-generation near-eye augmented reality (AR)/virtual reality (VR) display hardware puts forward growing requirements for high-performance, high-resolution luminous sources. Benefiting from outstanding luminous efficiency, tunable emission wavelength and convenient fabrication procedures, quantum dot light-emitting diodes (QLEDs) have gained extensive application prospects. However, achieving ultrahigh resolution without compromising device performance requires a balance between them, which is a major challenge for practical applications. In this Perspective, we introduce advanced patterning techniques for ultrahigh-resolution QLEDs, elaborate on the latest advancements in display technology, and summarize the key challenges and prospective research trends.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag549/8774606?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子点显示","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该展望文章介绍了面向超高分辨率量子点发光二极管（QLED）的先进图案化技术。近眼增强现实/虚拟现实显示对高性能、高分辨率光源需求日益增长，QLED凭借优异的发光效率、可调发射波长和便捷制备工艺具有广阔应用前景，但在不牺牲器件性能的前提下实现超高分辨率需要平衡二者关系，这是实际应用的重大挑战。文章阐述了显示技术的最新进展，并总结了关键挑战和未来研究方向。","kp":["分辨率与性能[超高分辨率QLED]: 需在不牺牲器件性能前提下实现超高分辨率，需平衡二者关系"]},{"t":"受体介导的内溶酶体回收嵌合体能够催化 TNF-α 降解，从而持续治疗粘膜炎症","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Mucosal inflammatory disorders such as dry eye disease (DED) and inflammatory bowel disease (IBD), driven by TNF‐α‐mediated immune‐epithelial crosstalk, remain therapeutically challenging. Conventional inhibitors often suffer from poor mucosal permeability and transient efficacy with 1:1 binding. Although extracellular protein degradation (eTPD) technologies can eliminate pathogenic proteins, most of them operate stoichiometrically, limiting dosage efficiency and durability. Here, we report a receptor‐mediated endolysosomal recycling chimera (RECYC) platform that enables catalytic, recyclable degradation of TNF‐α with multiple turnovers, achieving sustained suppression of mucosal inflammation. RECYC integrates a pH‐responsive peptide that binds TNF‐α at physiological pH and releases it in acidic endosomes, with a CI‐M6PR‐targeting aptamer that remains pH‐stable to drive continuous recycling. The anti‐TNF‐α RECYC achieved efficient uptake and recyclable clearance of extracellular TNF‐α across conjunctival and colonic epithelial cells and macrophages, achieving superstoichiometric TNF‐α clearance with up to 7.5 catalytic turnovers. The ∼30 kDa RECYC exhibited superior tissue penetration in murine cornea and colon compared to inhibitory antibodies. In murine DED and IBD models, RECYC restored ocular surface homeostasis and reduced colon inflammation with low‐dose, infrequent administration. Human corneal limbus organoids further confirmed prolonged anti‐inflammatory activity. Together, RECYC establishes a modular, recyclable eTPD platform for sustained treatment of TNF‐α‐driven mucosal inflammation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74818?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"室温下具有本征铁磁性的晶圆级超多孔石墨烯网络","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We report a wafer‐scale hyper‐porous graphene network (HGN) with room‐temperature intrinsic magnetism, which was revealed by both XMCD spectra at C K‐edge and M‐H curve, corresponding to a magnetic moment density of ∼0.06 μ\n                    B\n                    /atom, 1000 times higher than in defected HOPG. The impurity effects on magnetism were excluded by XMCD and ICP‐MS measurements. Atomic‐resolution observations unveiled that the magnetism originate from dangling zigzag edges within HGN pores apart over 1.4 nm, which was proved by annealing treatment and DFT calculations. This work confirms that intrinsic carbon ferromagnetism with the same physical mechanism as in the microscale can be obtained in bulk carbon systems. It provides a novel platform to further explore the spintronic and magnetic applications of carbon allotropes.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74568?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔石墨烯磁性","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究报道了具有室温本征磁性的晶圆级超多孔石墨烯网络（HGN）。C K边X射线磁圆二色谱和磁滞回线显示其磁矩密度约0.06 μB/原子，比缺陷HOPG高1000倍；XMCD和ICP-MS测量排除了杂质影响。原子分辨率观察表明磁性源于孔内间距超过1.4 nm的悬挂锯齿形边缘，并经退火处理和DFT计算证实。该工作确认了与微尺度相同物理机制的本征碳铁磁性可在块体碳体系中获得。","kp":["磁矩密度[室温本征铁磁性晶圆级超多孔石墨烯网络]: ~0.06 μB/atom","磁矩密度提升倍数[对比缺陷HOPG]: 高1000倍","磁性验证手段[排除杂质效应]: XMCD光谱与ICP-MS测量"]},{"t":"用于高性能神经形态计算的具有碳主链的烯烃连接离子共价有机框架","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Olefin‐linked covalent organic frameworks (\n                    cc\n                    COFs) have shown great advantages in the community since discovery. However, the synthesis of ccCOFs highly relies on unsaturated heteroatom‐involved segments (uSHS) to activate C─H bond to produce carbanion and to further condense with aldehydes. Such electron‐withdrawing uSHS have long hindered the wide applications of ccCOFs in optoelectronic devices due to the strong electron‐withdrawing effect. In this work, we report a carbenium‐involved synthesis of\n                    cc\n                    COFs without uSHS’ participating. As‐synthesized ionic\n                    cc\n                    COFs show good crystallinity and ultra‐narrow bandgap down to 1.03 eV without introducing complicated donor‐acceptor building blocks. Such\n                    cc\n                    COFs can also be directly synthesized as uniform films on different substrates, for example, glass, silicon wafer, Au, and so on. Most impressively, the device Au/2DPPPV‐102/Al exhibits 32 distinct conductance states under low‐voltage sweeps and each conductance state demonstrated excellent non‐volatility and could be maintained stably for over 5000 s, which are typical features of memristor. A convolutional neural network was implemented using a 32‐conductance‐state memristor array and applied to image recognition, yielding recognition accuracies exceeding 90% for five randomly selected images.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74807?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机框架材料","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该工作报道了一种无需不饱和杂原子链段（uSHS）参与的碳正离子参与的烯烃连接共价有机框架合成方法。传统ccCOFs合成依赖吸电子的uSHS活化C-H键产生碳负离子再与醛缩合，但强吸电子效应阻碍其在光电器件中的应用。新方法合成的离子型ccCOFs表现出良好的结晶性和低至1 eV左右的超窄带隙，具有碳主链结构，适用于高性能神经形态计算。","kp":["ccCOF合成依赖[传统工艺]: 依赖含不饱和杂原子的链段活化C─H键产生碳负离子并与醛缩合","应用瓶颈[光电器件]: 吸电子uSHS阻碍ccCOF在光电器件中的广泛应用"]},{"t":"通过电介质嵌入式 II 型 PbS/PbSe 量子点实现突触前光学调制，实现近红外神经形态视觉","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In nighttime perception and near‐infrared (NIR) neuromorphic vision, a central challenge lies in encoding weak optical inputs into stable and controllable temporal states at the sensor front end. In nocturnal mammalian retinas, AII amacrine cells achieve this function by relying on stable chemical intermediate states, presynaptic modulation, and subthreshold temporal integration. Functionally inspired by selected information‐processing principles of this mechanism, we propose and demonstrate a bio‐inspired device design strategy. Through a chemical‐structural codesign approach, type‐II PbS/PbSe core–shell quantum dots (QDs) are used for the first time and embedded into the dielectric layer of flexible carbon‐nanotube (CNT) synaptic transistors, forming stable yet decaying photo‐generated intermediate states. These states modulate the CNT channel conductance via photogating, realizing a presynaptic, nonconductive modulation. The synaptic device exhibits NIR perception covering 395–808 nm and operates with an energy consumption of 0.325 fJ per synaptic event. An 8 × 8 synaptic array enables history‐dependent temporal processing, generating 32 distinguishable output states under five‐bit optical inputs. Based on these properties, a reservoir computing (RC) framework is validated on a dataset exceeding 10\n                    5\n                    samples, achieving 94.6% accuracy in nighttime human action recognition tasks. These results establish a bio‐inspired material‐device‐system pathway for NIR near‐sensor temporal perception and computation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74345?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外视觉传感","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究受夜行哺乳动物视网膜中AII无长突细胞依赖稳定化学中间态、突触前调制和阈下时间整合机制的启发，通过化学-结构协同设计，首次将II型PbS/PbSe核壳量子点嵌入柔性碳纳米管突触晶体管的介电层中，实现突触前光学调制，将弱光学输入编码为稳定可控的时序状态，用于夜间感知和近红外神经形态视觉传感器前端。","kp":["突触前光学调制[近红外神经形态视觉]: 基于电介质嵌入式II型PbS/PbSe量子点实现弱光信号编码为稳定可控时间状态"]},{"t":"荧光纳米金刚石的离子浓度和电压成像","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The nitrogen‐vacancy (NV) center in diamond exists in different charge states with distinct photoluminescence properties, which are sensitive to the nanoscale electrochemical environment. Hence, the NV charge state is emerging as a powerful all‐optical platform for nanoscale sensing and imaging. Although significant progress has been made in engineering near‐surface NV centers in bulk diamond, controlling the NV charge state in fluorescent nanodiamonds (FNDs) has proven challenging, limiting the sensitivity and reliability of FND‐based charge state sensing. Here, we demonstrate reliable, reversible switching between the fluorescent NV\n                    0\n                    and a dark state, likely NV\n                    +\n                    , in sub‐30 nm FNDs via surface oxidation and hydrogenation, respectively, for single particles and particle powder. In aqueous electrochemical cells, we demonstrate voltage and ion concentration imaging based on the NV charge state in self‐assembled FND layers on transparent substrates. Applied voltages reliably modulate the FND PL with a sensitivity of up to 16 mV Hz\n                    −1/2\n                    . FND PL is also modulated by local changes in salt concentration with a sensitivity of up to 1.8% per millimolar NaCl, enabling all‐optical imaging of ion concentration gradients at the microscale. Our results represent a significant step toward realizing fast, stable, and scalable nanoscale charge‐ and voltage‐imaging technologies with sub‐micrometer spatial resolution.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74728?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米金刚石成像","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究展示了荧光纳米金刚石中NV0荧光态与暗态（可能为NV+）之间可靠、可逆的切换。金刚石中氮空位（NV）中心以不同电荷态存在，具有对纳米级电化学环境敏感的不同光致发光特性，可作为纳米级传感和成像的全光学平台。尽管块体金刚石近表面NV中心工程已取得进展，但荧光纳米金刚石中NV电荷态的控制一直颇具挑战，限制了基于电荷态传感的灵敏度和可靠性。","kp":["NV电荷态[荧光纳米金刚石]: 作为纳米尺度传感与成像的全光学平台，对纳米级电化学环境敏感"]},{"t":"不断生长的光纤传感器能够连续体内监测植物激素","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Plant stress during growth, caused by extreme environments and biotic attacks, threatens global biodiversity and crop production, necessitating urgent elucidation of plant adaptation mechanisms. Endogenous hormones of plant growth serve as master regulators and earliest indicators of stress adaptation, making it crucial to monitor their dynamics continuously. However, existing methods, including chromatography and electrochemical probes, fail because of their mismatch with the irreversible and plastic nature of plant growth. Here, we unexpectedly find a growing fiber sensor based on an electrode consisting of a dynamic polymer network infiltrated with liquid metal, termed metalgel. The sensor undergoes irreversible elongation ∼up to 10 times its original length under just 3.2 kPa tensile stress, at least 2 orders of magnitude lower than existing electronic conductive systems, thus achieving synchronous deformation with plant growth without inducing mechanical damage or hormonal disturbances. Hormone dynamics and relevant signaling pathways during plant growth in response to pathogen infection, salt stress, and even extreme ultraviolet radiation are thus revealed by the sensor. This work provides quantitative insights into plant stress resilience mechanisms and offers a feasible route to alleviate the food and ecological crises.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74856?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光纤植物传感","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究意外发现一种基于液态金属浸润动态聚合物网络电极（称为metalgel）的可生长光纤传感器，可随植物生长发生高达约10倍原始长度的不可逆伸长，实现植物激素的连续体内监测。极端环境和生物侵害引发的植物生长胁迫威胁全球生物多样性和作物生产，内源激素是胁迫适应的主调节因子和最早指标，但现有色谱和电化学探针方法因与植物生长的不可逆性和可塑性不匹配而无法实现动态连续监测。","kp":["连续监测能力[植物激素体内检测]: 不断生长的光纤传感器实现植物激素动态连续监测","现有方法局限[色谱与电化学探针]: 因与需求不匹配而无法实现连续监测"]},{"t":"层状卤化物钙钛矿纳米片中超空间结构驱动的能量漏斗","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Layered hybrid perovskites offer a versatile platform for tailoring light‐matter interactions, where alternative stacking of inorganic and organic layers creates complex couplings that disrupt the conventional crystal symmetry. Standard crystallographic models fall short of capturing the temperature‐dependent stacking disorder and multiplet excitonic features in these systems. Here, we introduce a four‐dimensional superspace framework, employing a phenomenological atomic modulation function, to describe the symmetry‐breaking interactions in Ruddlesden–Popper L\n                    2\n                    FA\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    ‐1\n                    [Sn\n                    0.022\n                    Pb\n                    0.978\n                    ]\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    I\n                    3\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    +1\n                    (L: oleylamine,\n                    n\n                    ≥ 2) nanoplatelet superlattices. Temperature‐tunable optical spectra reveal microcavity‐like excitonic confinement, while ultrafast transient absorption spectroscopy uncovers sub‐picosecond energy funneling through modulated quantum wells, facilitating a measurable and stable self‐powered photoresponse across a broad spectral range at room temperature. A rare coexistence of negative thermal expansion and quenching arises from anisotropic octahedral distortions and electron–phonon interactions. These findings establish a new structure‐function paradigm for designing thermally reconfigurable optoelectronic materials via engineered lattice modulation in hybrid perovskite superstructures.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74826?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿纳米片","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究引入四维超空间框架，采用唯象原子调制函数描述Ruddlesden-Pper型层状杂化钙钛矿中的对称性破缺相互作用。层状杂化钙钛矿中无机与有机层的交替堆叠形成复杂耦合、破坏常规晶体对称性，标准晶体学模型无法捕捉系统中温度依赖的堆叠无序和多重激子特征。该框架用于描述纳米片中超空间结构驱动的能量漏斗过程。","kp":["分析框架[层状杂化钙钛矿]: 引入四维超空间框架描述温度依赖堆叠无序与多重激子特征"]},{"t":"升级棒状微凝胶的制造：一种将逐步乳化与并行微通道中连续液滴限制相结合的微流体方法","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Anisometric rod‐shaped microgels are an emerging material class holding potential for tissue engineering. Their anisotropic shape has proven advantageous in the fabrication of granular hydrogels and microporous annealed particle scaffolds (MAPs), featuring larger pore sizes in comparison to their spherical counterparts. However, to enable the use of rod‐shaped microgels as building blocks for high‐throughput tissue models, a robust and scalable production method is needed. Here, we report a microfluidic fabrication method to produce rod‐shaped microgels by combining step‐emulsification (SE) and droplet confinement. We highlight the development of the microfluidic chip design, and characterize the properties of the microgel rods produced via on‐chip gelation, using two light‐induced polymerization chemistries. Compared to single‐channel microfluidic techniques, rod‐shaped microgels are generated in eight parallelized microchannels in a relevant size range for tissue engineering applications, holding potential for further upscaling.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74822?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微凝胶制造","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种结合逐步乳化和并行微通道中连续液滴限制的微流控制造方法，用于生产棒状微凝胶。各向异性棒状微凝胶在构建颗粒水凝胶和微孔退火颗粒支架方面相比球形微凝胶具有更大孔径的优势，是组织工程的新兴材料，但作为高通量组织模型的构建单元需要稳健可扩展的生产方法。研究重点介绍了微流控芯片设计开发，并对芯片上凝胶化制备的微凝胶棒性能进行了表征。","kp":["棒状微凝胶优势[对比球形微凝胶]: 各向异性形状使粒状水凝胶和MAPs支架具有更大孔径","制造方法[棒状微凝胶规模化]: 将逐步乳化与并行微通道连续液滴限制相结合的微流体方法"]},{"t":"利用近红外发光金属卤化物对植物水分含量进行非破坏性高保真传感","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Real‐time, accurate water monitoring is a crucial technical foundation for industrial, environmental, and biological research. However, traditional detection methods typically include destructive processes and suffer from response delays. Near‐infrared (NIR) luminescent metal halides offer a novel solution to this challenge, but they still face issues such as ultraviolet excitation and low photoelectric conversion efficiency. Herein, a luminescent material was synthesized based on the blue‐light‐excited lead‐free perovskite Cs\n                    2\n                    HfCl\n                    6\n                    :Te\n                    4+\n                    /Mo\n                    4+\n                    , in which energy transfer (ET) from Te\n                    4+\n                    to Mo\n                    4+\n                    enables highly efficient NIR luminescence in the 800–1200 nm wavelength range. Upon encapsulation with a commercial blue light chip, the fabricated NIR light‐emitting diode device achieved a photoelectric conversion efficiency of up to 16.1%. By utilizing the absorption characteristics of water molecules in the NIR spectrum and receiving signals via a sensor. An interactive learning process based on a neural network machine learning algorithm was employed, achieving an estimation accuracy of up to 98.6% for plant water content. This non‐destructive and precise NIR detection module provides a new solution for the real‐time monitoring of crop physiological status and holds broad application prospects in the fields of precision agriculture and plant science.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74821?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属卤化物传感","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究合成了一种基于蓝光激发的无铅钙钛矿Cs2HfCl6:Te4+/Mo4+的近红外发光材料用于植物水分含量的非破坏性高保真传感，其中涉及能量转移过程。实时准确的水分监测是工业、环境和生物研究的重要技术基础，但传统检测方法通常包含破坏性过程且存在响应延迟；近红外发光金属卤化物虽提供了新方案，但此前面临紫外激发和光电转换效率低的问题。","kp":["传感特性[近红外发光金属卤化物]: 非破坏性、高保真植物水分含量监测","现有问题[近红外发光金属卤化物]: 紫外激发与低光电转换效率"]},{"t":"双功能催化驱动高效的乙醇生产水性 Zn-CO2 电池","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bifunctional electrocatalysts that simultaneously drive CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (CO\n                    2\n                    RR) and oxygen evolution (OER) in neutral electrolytes are essential for aqueous Zn‐CO\n                    2\n                    batteries (AZCBs), but conventional designs prioritize CO\n                    2\n                    RR and are often incompatible with OER, resulting in low energy efficiency, poor reversibility, and rapid degradation of batteries. Here, we introduce a unified catalyst architecture integrating Cu and Ni single atoms with boron‐, nitrogen‐co‐doped carbon (CuNi@BNC‐T). Heteroatom co‐doping stabilizes high single‐atom loadings, enhances metal‐support interactions, and suppresses carbon corrosion, while N‐coordinated Cu\n                    +\n                    and Ni\n                    3+\n                    sites cooperatively boost CO\n                    2\n                    RR‐OER, enabling ethanol formation and low‐overpotential OER. This strategy achieves a 0.7 V voltage gap at 5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , 522 h cycling at 20 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , and first ethanol production via AZCBs with energy efficiency of 88% (flow‐cell). By elucidating previously unresolved degradation pathways, this work also correlates catalyst dynamics with battery failure, establishing design principles for durable bifunctional catalysts in aqueous Zn‐CO\n                    2\n                    systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74846?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碳电池催化","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种将Cu和Ni单原子与硼、氮共掺杂碳集成的统一催化剂架构（CuNi@BNC-T），用于水性Zn-CO2电池中的双功能催化。中性电解质中同时驱动CO2还原和析氧的双功能电催化剂对水系Zn-CO2电池至关重要，但常规设计优先考虑CO2还原且常与析氧反应不兼容，导致能量效率低、可逆性差和电池快速衰减。杂原子共掺杂稳定了高单原子负载并增强了金属-载体相互作用，实现高效乙醇生产。","kp":["双功能催化剂[水系Zn-CO2电池/中性电解液]: 同时驱动CO2RR与OER，解决常规设计OER兼容性差的问题"]},{"t":"将π共轭氨基酸纳入多功能无定形材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The controlled fabrication of amorphous materials from small organic molecules and their translation into high‐performance functional materials remain long‐standing challenges. Here, we introduce a multicomponent assembly strategy to developed amorphous materials from π‐conjugated amino acids, offering a versatile platform for high‐performance adhesive and optical applications. The incorporation of proline‐based building blocks into multicomponent networks bypasses the crystallization‐induced self‐assembly that otherwise dominates in solution, thereby driving liquid‐liquid phase separation‐like pathways to yield amorphous aggregates. These aggregates exhibit exceptional thermoreversible adhesion to iron‐based substrates, with their densely packed architecture facilitating rarely observed excimer emission of fluorene. Furthermore, enhanced charge‐transfer interactions with 1,2,4,5‐tetracyanobenzene shift the photoluminescence from indigo to green, increase the quantum yield by orders of magnitude, and transition the emission from short‐lived prompt fluorescence to long‐lived thermally activated delayed fluorescence. Through supercooling, amorphous glasses with high hardness and optical transparency were successfully fabricated, wherein increasing the number of components enables systematic tuning of surface roughness, wettability, quantum yield, emission wavelength, and excited‐state lifetime. This work establishes a novel paradigm for synthesizing amorphous materials within multicomponent high‐entropy systems, positioning amino acid and short peptide derivatives as a versatile class of biomolecular building blocks for advanced adhesive and photonic applications.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74865?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨基酸无定形材料","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究提出多组分组装策略，由π共轭氨基酸制备无定形材料，为高性能粘附和光学应用提供多功能平台。将脯氨酸基结构单元纳入多组分网络可绕过溶液中占主导的结晶诱导自组装，驱动类似液-液相分离的路径形成无定形聚集体。这些聚集体对铁基基底表现出优异的热可逆粘附性，其致密堆积结构有利于相关功能特性，解决了小分子无定形材料的可控构筑及其向高性能功能材料转化的长期挑战。","kp":["组装策略[π共轭氨基酸无定形材料]: 多组分组装，纳入脯氨酸基结构单元构建网络"]},{"t":"用于远程 X 射线检测的稳定杂配混合玻璃闪烁光纤","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Long‐distance and flexible optical fiber scintillators are essential under extreme operating conditions including interventional radiology and remote nuclear reactor monitoring, etc. Organic–inorganic hybrid glass fibers offer a promising solution, yet transforming cluster glasses into stable photonic architectures remains challenging. Here we report a heteroleptic strategy that exploits steric hindrance effects to precisely modulate the thermodynamic properties of hybrid Cu\n                    4\n                    I\n                    4\n                    cluster glass, further enabling ultralong, fracture‐free, and perturbation‐free TPP\n                    2\n                    MDP\n                    2\n                    Cu\n                    4\n                    I\n                    4\n                    (TPP = Triphenylphosphine; MDP = Methyldiphenylphosphine) glass fibers. The heteroleptic TPP\n                    2\n                    MDP\n                    2\n                    Cu\n                    4\n                    I\n                    4\n                    core glass not only overcomes the stability limitations of hybrid systems, but also exhibits a notable light yield of 38598 photons MeV\n                    −1\n                    and a low detection limit of 62.2 nGy s\n                    −1\n                    . We assemble these fibers into a flexible scintillation fiber array capable of imaging internal defects in confined spaces. This heteroleptic design principle in cluster glass platform can be extended to other hybrid glass fibers for emerging photonic applications.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74844?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"玻璃闪烁光纤","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种杂配体策略，利用空间位阻效应精确调控杂化Cu4I4簇玻璃的热力学性质，制备出超长、无断裂、无扰动的TPP2MDP2Cu基混合玻璃闪烁光纤，用于介入放射学和远程核反应堆监测等极端工况下的远程X射线检测。有机-无机杂化玻璃光纤是长距离柔性光纤闪烁体的有前景方案，但将簇玻璃转化为稳定光子架构一直颇具挑战。","kp":["杂配策略[混合玻璃闪烁光纤]: 利用空间位阻效应调控热力学，实现稳定光子结构"]},{"t":"交变磁场诱导电子重构制备高磁化率纳米 FeS2","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Magnetic materials, such as\n                    Ferumoxytol\n                    and Gd‐DTPA, have played an important role in biomedical areas. The relentless pursuit of novel magnetic materials that are clinically applicable is an eternal theme in biomedical engineering. Pyrite (FeS\n                    2\n                    ) is a mineral drug in China that has been used for a long history. Besides the inherent biocompatibility proved in the human body as well as the donor of H\n                    2\n                    S, pyrite also belongs to the family of transition metal dichalcogenides, which endows it with flexible functional tunability of magnetism to be a promising candidate for novel magnetic nanodrug. However, the nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    synthesized by common coprecipitation often shows poor magnetic susceptibility, so its application has greatly been limited. Herein, we reported an innovative strategy to prepare nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    with high magnetic susceptibility (HS‐nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    ) via alternating magnetic field‐assisted coprecipitation. AMF treatment effectively regulated electronic reconstruction of Fe\n                    2+\n                    in nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    without foreign‐element doping, and super‐exchange interaction is proposed as the dominant factor for the optimized magnetic susceptibility toward a favorable spin‐polarized configuration. The HS‐nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    is suitable for long‐term MR angiography imaging with excellent biosafety. We believe HS‐nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    provides a novel magnetic candidate for clinical translation and demonstrates an innovative strategy at the electronic level.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74842?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米磁材制备","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用交变磁场诱导电子重构制备高磁化率纳米FeS2。黄铁矿（FeS2）是中国的矿物药物，具有长期使用历史，已被证明在人体内具有固有生物相容性，可作为H2S供体；同时它属于过渡金属二硫化物家族，具有灵活的磁性功能可调性，是新型磁性纳米药物的候选者，有望补充Ferumoxytol和Gd-DTPA等现有生物医学磁性材料。","kp":["纳米FeS2[交变磁场诱导电子重构]: 高磁化率，具有天然生物相容性的矿物药物"]},{"t":"激光定义的反应拓扑实现了可扩展钙钛矿光伏的可控固态转变","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Controlling reaction pathways in solids is critical for scalable semiconductor fabrication, yet remains fundamentally challenging in solution‐processed systems due to constrained mass transport and diffusion‐limited conversion. In perovskite photovoltaics, the widely adopted sequential two‐step deposition method is particularly limited by dense PbI\n                    2\n                    precursor layers, which impede ion diffusion and lead to incomplete conversion and defect formation. Here we report a photonic strategy to spatially regulate solid‐state reaction pathways by engineering micro‐ and nanoscale channels within PbI\n                    2\n                    layers. Laser‐induced structures act as deterministic diffusion pathways, enabling controlled ion transport and spatially guided infiltration of organic salts, thereby transforming a diffusion‐limited process into a spatially coordinated reaction. Mechanistic investigations reveal that photonic structuring redistributes the local electronic environment and lowers the activation barrier for phase transformation, resulting in accelerated conversion, enhanced crystallinity, and reduced defect density. The resulting perovskite films exhibit improved carrier dynamics. Perovskite solar modules with an aperture area of 22.95  cm\n                    2\n                    achieve a record power conversion efficiency of 22.83%, retaining over 90% of their initial performance after 1,500 h under maximum power point tracking. This work establishes photonic control of reaction pathways as a general framework for controlled solid‐state transformations.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74828?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿光伏","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种光子策略，通过在PbI2前驱层中构筑微米和纳米级通道，利用激光诱导结构作为确定性扩散路径，空间调控固态反应路径，解决钙钛矿光伏两步沉积法中致密PbI2层阻碍离子扩散、转化不完全和缺陷形成的问题，实现可控固态转变与可扩展钙钛矿光伏制备。","kp":["激光定义反应拓扑[钙钛矿光伏两步沉积]: 可控固态转变，缓解致密PbI2前驱层阻碍离子扩散的问题"]},{"t":"用于高性能机械发光结构的多功能牺牲模具辅助 3D 打印，以实现冲击保护和可视化监控","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mechanoluminescence (ML) materials exhibit significant potential for visual sensing and structural monitoring owing to their self‐powered operation and capability for real‐time stress mapping. However, the fabrication of complex and high‐aspect‐ratio 3D ML geometries remains challenging, primarily constrained by poor rheological control in direct ink writing and the limited adaptability of conventional demolding. Herein, this study proposes an indirect 3D printing strategy based on sacrificial molds to fabricate complex ZnS:Cu/polydimethylsiloxane (PDMS) structures with exceptional structural fidelity. By integrating digital image correlation (DIC) technology, a quantitative correlation between strain fields and ML intensity fields is successfully established. Furthermore, a 3D negative Poisson's ratio ML structure (NPR‐ML/PDMS) filled with silicone is designed for complex service scenarios, enabling the synergistic integration of impact protection and real‐time visualized impact sensing. NPR‐ML/PDMS reduces peak impact force by 60% and enhances ML intensity by 89%, demonstrating its potential for intelligent protective systems. Finally, this sacrificial mold method is successfully extended to ZnS/CaZnOS:Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    /epoxy resin and CaZnOS:Pr, Li‐based composite systems to achieve stress visualization in rigid load‐bearing structures, validating its broad universality across various polymer matrices. This work provides valuable guidance for the development and application of complex, high‑performance ML structures in impact protection and visualization monitoring fields.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74840?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"机械发光3D打印","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出基于牺牲模具的间接3D打印策略，制备结构保真度优异的复杂ZnS:Cu/聚二甲基硅氧烷(PDMS)机械发光结构，克服直写成型流变控制差和传统脱模适应性有限的问题。结合数字图像相关(DIC)技术，建立了应变场与ML强度场之间的定量关联，实现自供电实时应力映射，用于冲击保护和可视化结构监控。","kp":["牺牲模具辅助3D打印[机械发光结构]: 间接打印方式，可制造复杂高深宽比3D几何结构用于冲击保护与可视化监控"]},{"t":"具有金属扰动配体内电荷转移态的 Pd(II)-TADF 配合物：高效红色 OLED 的发射体和敏化剂","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The metal‐perturbed intraligand charge transfer (MPICT) excited state has proven to be a viable design strategy for thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) complexes featuring a metal–donor–acceptor configuration. However, the structure‐photophysics correlation and the applications of such complexes for organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) remain largely unexplored. Herein, we report a series of Pd(II) complexes (\n                    Pd3\n                    –\n                    Pd6\n                    ) having dibenzo[\n                    a\n                    ,\n                    c\n                    ]phenazine (DBPZ)‐substituted carbazolyl ligands with varied torsion angles. The energy gap between the lowest singlet and triplet excited states is tuned from 0.05 eV to 0.26 eV, which governs the emission mechanism and radiative decay rate. Complex\n                    Pd3\n                    exhibits strong red TADF with a photoluminescence quantum yield of 82% and a lifetime of 1.13 µs. In bottom‐emitting OLEDs,\n                    Pd3\n                    affords red electroluminescence with a peak at 617 nm, a maximum external quantum efficiency (EQE\n                    max\n                    ) of 30.15%, and a small efficiency roll‐off of 2.32% at 1000 cd m\n                    −2\n                    . In top‐emitting ITO‐free OLEDs,\n                    Pd3\n                    shows pure‐red emission with CIE\n                    x\n                    &gt; 0.68 and an EQE\n                    max\n                    of 38.68%.\n                    Pd3\n                    is also demonstrated as an efficient sensitizer for a red‐emitting multi‐resonance emitter, enabling hyperfluorescence OLEDs with an EQE\n                    max\n                    of 27.06% and suppressed efficiency roll‐off. These results highlight the potential of MPICT‐type Pd(II) complexes for high‐performance OLED displays.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74823?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OLED发光材料","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"金属扰动配体内电荷转移(MPICT)激发态是构建金属-给体-受体构型热激活延迟荧光(TADF)配合物的可行设计策略。研究报道了一系列Pd(II)配合物(Pd3–Pd6)，采用具有不同扭转角的二苯并[a,c]吩嗪(DBPZ)取代咔唑基配体，探讨最低单重态与三重态间能隙等结构-光物理关联，并将其应用于高效红色OLED的发射体和敏化剂。","kp":["发射体/敏化剂[高效红色OLED]: Pd(II)-TADF配合物，基于金属扰动配体内电荷转移(MPICT)激发态"]},{"t":"哈·阮","b":"\"I advise my students to keep asking themselves \"why\" and to strive for excellence in everything they do… The most exciting thing about my research is sharing my passion for science with students and watching them become excited about their own work…\" Find out more about Ha L. Nguyen in his Introducing… Profile.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7114284?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"DogMask：用于条件蛋白质缀合的基因编码开关","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Protein conjugation enables the modular assembly of functional proteins but is largely incompatible with stimulus‐responsive platforms due to spontaneous reactivity. Here, we present DogMask, a genetically encoded platform that achieves input‐triggered protein conjugation by autoinhibiting a spontaneous conjugation platform, DogCatcher, with a competitive inhibitor mask. DogMask exhibits no detectable background conjugation and rapid activation in response to distinct inputs—including clinically relevant proteases and a photocleavable non‐standard amino acid variant achieving 70% cleavage efficiency, exceeding prior benchmarks—properties enabling robust intracellular control of transcription, RNA editing, and enzyme reconstitution, with both substantially reduced background and enhanced response relative to inducible dimerization systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5004113?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质缀合开关","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"DogMask是一种基因编码平台，通过竞争性抑制剂掩蔽物自抑制自发蛋白质缀合平台DogCatcher，实现输入触发的蛋白质缀合。该平台无检测背景缀合，可对多种输入快速激活，包括临床相关蛋白酶及可光切割非标准氨基酸变体（切割效率达70%，超越以往基准）。该特性可实现对转录、RNA编辑和酶重构的稳健胞内控制，并显著降低背景。","kp":["DogMask[基因编码蛋白质缀合]: 自抑制平台，无可检测背景缀合，可被多种输入快速激活"]},{"t":"通过脉冲电解和界面工程的时空耦合实现乙二醇氧化中接近统一的乙醛酸选择性","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical cascade reactions suffer from suboptimal selectivity toward high‐value intermediates due to the uncontrollable sequential conversion inherent in conventional steady‐state electrolysis. To transcend the intrinsic limitations of one‐dimensional control, we propose a spatiotemporal synergy strategy for precision electrocatalysis. In this framework, the temporal dimension is governed by pulsed electrolysis, facilitating the rhythmic generation and rapid liberation of target intermediates. Simultaneously, the spatial dimension is engineered via molecular steric modifiers (\n                    p\n                    ‐toluidine) to create a persistent hydrophobic interface that effectively suppresses deleterious hydration‐driven overoxidation pathways. Synergistically, this dual‐dimensional orchestration achieves unprecedented precision, as evidenced by a dramatic leap in glyoxylate selectivity from 25.5% to &gt;99.0%. This work demonstrates a promising and transferable design principle for precision electrocatalysis in complex reaction networks. The spatiotemporal decoupling strategy, integrating temporal pulsed electrolysis for intermediate release and spatial interface engineering for overconsumption suppression, is demonstrated here for ethylene glycol oxidation and provides a rational basis for addressing similar selectivity challenges in other electrocatalytic systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3451661?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙二醇电氧化","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对常规稳态电解中连续转化不可控导致级联电化学反应对高价值中间体选择性不佳的问题，研究提出时空协同的精密电催化策略：时间维度采用脉冲电解，促进目标中间体的节律性生成与快速释放；空间维度利用分子空间位阻修饰剂（对甲苯胺）构筑持久疏水界面，抑制有害的水合驱动过度氧化，在乙二醇氧化中实现接近统一的乙醛酸选择性。","kp":["乙醛酸选择性[乙二醇氧化/脉冲电解+界面工程]: 接近100%（接近统一选择性）"]},{"t":"打破热力学疏水性-活性权衡以促进 CO2 电还原为甲酸盐的双齿螯合策略","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving industrially relevant electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (CO\n                    2\n                    RR) to formic acid requires catalyst that simultaneously exhibits high intrinsic activity and surface hydrophobicity. However, high intrinsic activity is considered thermodynamically contradictory on a hydrophobic surface since high hydrophobicity corresponds to low surface energy, thereby leading to low intrinsic activity. Here we overcome this hydrophobicity‐activity trade‐off via a bidentate chelation strategy that grafts carboxylic acid molecules with tunable alkyl chain lengths on Bi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    3\n                    (XC‐BOC, where X denotes the carbon number). The obtained 10C‐BOC sustains high hydrophobicity without sacrificing activity. This hydrophobicity‐activity balance is achieved by restructuring the interfacial hydrogen‐bond (HB) network to suppress the undesired hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and ensure the timely hydrogenation rate for the key *OCHO intermediate, in conjunction with modulating the Bi site electronic structure via the carboxyl‐O/Bi bidentate chelation to guarantee the high intrinsic activity. Consequently, 10C‐BOC achieves ampere‐level performance with FE\n                    HCOO‐\n                    &gt; 90% from 100–1000 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , with an optimal FE\n                    HCOO‐\n                    of 97.7% at 600 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    (vs. 83.2% for bare BOC), and maintains FE\n                    HCOO‐\n                    &gt; 93% at 200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    for 200 h. This work offers a general strategy to decouple hydrophobicity from intrinsic activity for advanced CO\n                    2\n                    RR electrocatalysts.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9439653?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2还原甲酸","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"电化学CO2还原制甲酸需要催化剂兼具高本征活性和表面疏水性，但疏水表面对应低表面能，与高活性存在热力学矛盾。研究通过双齿螯合策略，在Bi2O2CO3上接枝具有可调烷基链长的羧酸分子，打破疏水性-活性权衡，实现CO2电还原高效生成甲酸盐。","kp":["双齿螯合策略[CO2电还原制甲酸盐]: 打破热力学疏水性-活性权衡，兼具高本征活性与表面疏水性"]},{"t":"由分子马达定制的神经工程，具有自我报告功能，可用于神经元激活和抑郁症治疗","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The discovery of mechanical regulation to neuronal behavior offers a novel perspective for understanding nervous system function and advancing neural engineering. A key challenge lies in achieving precise mechanical control of neurons while simultaneously monitoring their activity in real time. Here, we engineered a novel molecular machine equipped with self‐reporting capability, MM‐VSD1, enabling stable anchoring into the plasma membrane. This integrated molecular tool comprises a light‐driven rotary molecular motor (MM), which delivers localized mechanical force to neuronal membranes. Concurrently, a tethered near‐infrared voltage‐sensitive dye (VSD1) module provides real‐time fluorescent feedback on changes in membrane potentials with millisecond temporal and subcellular spatial resolution. Utilizing this bifunctional molecular device, we demonstrate that MM‐VSD1 effectively activates mechanosensitive TRPV1 ion channels in hippocampal neurons, triggering calcium influx and action potential (AP) firing. This mechanical modulation induced by MM‐VSD1 is persistent and can be evoked in vivo up to one week, providing the potential of MM‐VSD1 for alleviating depression‐like behaviors in mice. By bridging mechanical manipulation with functional readouts at high spatiotemporal resolution, our work opens an avenue for mechano‐based therapeutic interventions in neurological disorders.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2883647?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"神经工程分子马达","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究设计了一种具有自我报告功能的新型分子机器MM-VSD1，可稳定锚定于细胞质膜。该工具集成光驱动旋转分子马达(MM)，向神经元膜施加局部机械力；同时通过偶联的近红外电压敏感染料(VSD1)模块，以毫秒级时间分辨率实时荧光反馈膜电位变化，实现对神经元激活的精确机械控制与同步监测，用于抑郁症治疗等神经工程应用。","kp":["分子机器[神经元机械调控]: MM-VSD1，具备自我报告功能，可稳定锚定于细胞质膜"]},{"t":"用于功能导向离电极电合成的多孔固体电解质反应器","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrosynthesis offers an attractive route to sustainable chemical manufacturing when coupled with renewable electricity. As electrosynthesis capability advances towards high‐purity products, the traditional proximity of reaction products to the electrode surface, where the reaction happens, increasingly becomes a limiting factor. In addition, the formation and transport of reactive species are confined in the same chamber, resulting in electrolyte contamination of the product. Porous solid electrolyte (PSE) reactors address this spatial constraint by introducing an additional ion‐conductive middle layer between the cathode and anode, enabling a versatile off‐electrode space for product formation and transportation. Here, we frame PSE reactors as function‐oriented platforms for off‐electrode electrosynthesis, in which the PSE middle layer serves as a functional reaction space that enables ionic recombination, reaction‐environment regulation, and improved management of reactive intermediates. By linking the underlying ionic‐species transport mechanisms and reactor design principles, we establish a structure‐transport‐function framework for understanding how PSE reactors extend electrosynthesis beyond the electrode surface confinement and guide the rational design of scalable electrosynthesis reactors as on‐site chemical manufacturing platforms.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5622879?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离电极电合成","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"多孔固体电解质(PSE)反应器通过在阴极与阳极之间引入额外的离子导电中间层，为产物生成与传输提供多功能'离电极'空间，解决了传统电解合成中反应产物邻近电极表面及活性物种形成与传输共处一室导致电解质污染产物的空间限制问题，推动与可再生电力耦合的电合成向高纯产品方向发展。","kp":["多孔固体电解质反应器[离电极电合成]: 实现产物与电极表面分离，避免电解液污染"]},{"t":"镁保留辅助合成高性能 Zintl 热电材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    For decades, performance optimization of Mg\n                    3\n                    (Bi, Sb)\n                    2\n                    ‐based thermoelectric materials has mainly relied on doping and alloying strategies, while the influence of synthesis‐process innovation on thermoelectric mechanisms and properties has remained largely unexplored. Here, we develop a magnesium‐retention assisted synthesis (MRAS) strategy that stabilizes Mg through a sacrificial Mg reservoir and an inert‐gas‐regulated melting environment, effectively suppressing Mg volatilization and chemical instability during high‐temperature synthesis. MRAS enables scalable fabrication of phase‐pure, compositionally uniform Mg‐based alloys without costly tantalum encapsulation. The resulting Mg‐rich Mg\n                    3.15\n                    Bi\n                    1.5\n                    Sb\n                    0.49\n                    Te\n                    0.01\n                    features interconnected Mg‐rich regions and multiscale defects that synergistically promote electrical transport and suppress lattice thermal conductivity, delivering an ultrahigh power factor of 41.7 µW cm\n                    −1\n                    K\n                    −2\n                    , a\n                    ZT\n                    of 1.2 ± 0.1 at 323 K, and a peak\n                    ZT\n                    of 1.8 ± 0.1 at 523 K. MRAS is also compatible with conventional compositional engineering: Ba doping at the Mg site further reduces thermal conductivity through point‐defect scattering while largely preserving the power factor, yielding a\n                    ZT\n                    around 1.9 ± 0.1 at 523 K in Mg\n                    3.144\n                    Ba\n                    0.006\n                    Bi\n                    1.5\n                    Sb\n                    0.49\n                    Te\n                    0.01\n                    . Moreover, successful extension to MgCu\n                    2\n                    and MgAgSb highlights the broad applicability of MRAS as a scalable synthesis platform for high‐performance Mg‐based materials.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9935383?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电材料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对Mg3(Bi,Sb)2基热电材料性能优化长期依赖掺杂和合金化的问题，研究开发镁保留辅助合成(MRAS)策略，通过牺牲镁储库和惰性气体调控熔融环境，有效抑制高温合成过程中的镁挥发和化学不稳定性，无需昂贵钽封装即可规模化制备相纯、成分均匀的镁基合金，实现高性能Zintl热电材料。","kp":["Mg3(Bi,Sb)2热电材料[镁保留辅助合成MRAS]: 通过稳定Mg实现合成工艺创新，提升热电性能"]},{"t":"芳香族单铵的奇偶烷基链对 Ruddlesden-Popper 二维钙钛矿层间结构和稳定性的影响","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ruddlesden–Popper (RP) 2D perovskites with organic bilayers attract great interest for optoelectronics owing to their high stability and tunable functionality. However, the relationship between the interlayer architecture, molecular configuration of aromatic cations, and resulting stability remains poorly understood. Herein, we systematically investigate phenyl alkylammonium‐based RP 2D perovskites with varying alkyl chain lengths (─(CH\n                    2\n                    )\n                    m\n                    NH\n                    3\n                    +\n                    with m = 1–4) of organic cations. We find that odd‐carbon cations (m = 1, 3) preferentially form type‐I 2D perovskites featuring interdigitated organic cations, which induces substantial inorganic distortion and lower octahedral symmetry to the\n                    C\n                    1\n                    point group. Even‐carbon cations (m = 2, 4) favor type‐II 2D perovskites with well‐defined interlayer gaps, wherein the alkylammonium groups rotate to optimize registry with the inorganic sublattice, minimizing distortion and yielding higher‐symmetry\n                    \n                      D\n                      2\n                    \n                    h\n                    octahedra. Furthermore, we demonstrate that intrinsic structural stability of RP 2D perovskites is primarily governed by π–π packing within the organic layer, whereas air stability of the thin films is determined by surface hydrophobicity. The type‐II films exhibit higher hydrophobicity, conferring enhanced stability under ambient conditions compared to type‐I films. These findings establish odd‐even alkyl chain parity as a design principle for tailoring structurally diverse yet stable RP 2D perovskites.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6772439?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿稳定","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究系统考察了苯基烷基铵阳离子烷基链长(─(CH2)mNH3+，m=1-4)对Ruddlesden-Popper二维钙钛矿层间结构与稳定性的影响。发现奇数碳阳离子(m=1,3)优先形成具有交错排列有机阳离子的I型二维钙钛矿，阐明了层间构型、芳香阳离子分子构型与稳定性之间的关联。","kp":["RP二维钙钛矿[苯基烷基铵间隔阳离子]: 烷基链奇偶性调控层间结构与稳定性"]},{"t":"突破表面：浮力金属-聚合物开孔混合晶格超材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metallic lattice metamaterials have demonstrated transformative potential across biomedical, aerospace, defense, and thermal engineering. Yet their application in buoyant marine structures has remained elusive, as their open‐cell architectures inherently prevent flotation, even at densities below that of water. Here, we present the first buoyant metal–polymer open‐cell hybrid lattice metamaterial. The design is guided by a novel skeletal density framework, built around an environment‐independent buoyancy parameter that excludes externally accessible porosity. The resulting hybrid architecture combines Ti‐6Al‐4V hollow‐strut lattices (HSLs)—fabricated by laser‐based powder bed fusion (PBF‐LB)—with expandable polyurethane (PU) foam injected into the internal channels of each strut. This architecture retains external open‐cell permeability while achieving skeletal densities below 1.0 g/cm\n                    3\n                    , enabling reliable buoyancy prediction and control. Real‐world applicability is demonstrated using a Ti‑6Al‑4V+PU hybrid buoy that floats stably in natural seawater. This hybrid architecture exhibits higher specific strength than conventional marine materials such as high‑density polyethylene (HDPE) and 316L stainless steel (SS316L). Seawater immersion tests further demonstrate corrosion resistance and water‑exclusion capability. Finite‑element simulations elucidate fracture initiation and predict failure modes consistent with experimental observations. Importantly, these hybrid buoyant architectures preserve flotation even after severe structural damage. This work introduces a new class of buoyant metamaterials and establishes skeletal density as a general design principle for open‑cell structures in targeted liquid media.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74641?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"晶格超材料","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究报道首个浮力金属-聚合物开孔混合晶格超材料。设计基于新型骨架密度框架，采用与环境无关的浮力参数（排除外部可达孔隙度）。混合架构将由激光粉末床熔融(PBF-LB)制备的Ti-6Al-4V空心支柱晶格与注入的可膨胀聚氨酯(PU)泡沫结合，突破开孔结构本质上无法漂浮的限制，可用于浮力海洋结构。","kp":["金属-聚合物开孔混合晶格超材料[海上浮力结构]: 首个可实现漂浮的开孔金属晶格超材料，由骨架密度函数设计指导"]},{"t":"钛催化合成带有季碳中心的多取代戊二酰亚胺——范围、机制和生物活性研究","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Glutarimides possess prominent pharmacological activities. Nevertheless, general and facile synthetic approaches toward multisubstituted glutarimides remain scarce, particularly for analogues with α, α‐disubstituted structures and substitutions at diverse sites of the imide core. In this work, we developed a radical alkylation/cyclization cascade of α‐tertiary haloamides and acrylates using earth‐abundant titanium as the catalyst. This transformation provides a practical route to glutarimides featuring quaternary carbon centers and multi‐functionalized imide skeletons. Both\n                    N\n                    ‐unsubstituted glutarimides and derivatives with tunable\n                    N\n                    ‐substituents can be readily accessed, including analogues derived from bioactive and pharmaceutical scaffolds. Furthermore, the antiproliferative potency of these newly synthesized glutarimides was assessed using HeLa and glioblastoma U87 cell lines.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6119479?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钛催化合成","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究开发了一种以地壳丰度高的钛为催化剂的自由基烷基化/环化级联反应，以α-叔代卤代酰胺与丙烯酸酯为原料，合成含季碳中心和多功能化酰亚胺骨架的多取代戊二酰亚胺。该方法可便捷制备N-未取代戊二酰亚胺及N-取代基可调的衍生物，弥补了此类药物活性分子合成方法稀缺的问题，并研究了反应范围、机制和生物活性。","kp":["催化剂[多取代戊二酰亚胺合成]: 地球丰产钛，催化α-叔卤代酰胺与丙烯酸酯的自由基烷基化/环化级联反应，构建季碳中心"]},{"t":"用于海水光催化的一维共价有机框架中的共轭控制离子响应","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic hydrogen evolution from seawater offers a sustainable route for energy production, yet the role of dissolved ions in modulating carrier dynamics remains poorly understood. Herein, we demonstrate conjugation‐controlled ion responses that regulate charge separation in one‐dimensional covalent organic frameworks (1D COFs) through ion‐induced polarization for seawater photocatalysis. Two COFs featuring localized (DHP‐COF) and extended (DHPD‐COF) conjugation are constructed. In natural seawater, DHP‐COF achieves 246.9 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    for hydrogen evolution, 5.03‐fold higher than in pure water (49.1 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ), whereas DHPD‐COF shows only 2.48‐fold enhancement (from 38.9 to 96.5 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ), revealing markedly stronger ion‐responsive sensitivity in the locally conjugated framework. Mechanistic investigations reveal that localized conjugation preserves spatially inhomogeneous polar domains arising from segmented π‐electron distribution, enabling strong coupling with seawater ions and thereby amplifying local dipoles to generate enhanced internal electric fields for efficient charge separation. In contrast, extended π‐delocalization leads to electronic homogenization that attenuates ion‐induced polarization. Beyond hydrogen production, this system simultaneously achieves chemoselective hydrogenation of\n                    α\n                    ,\n                    β\n                    ‐unsaturated carbonyl compounds to high‐value pharmaceutical intermediates in natural seawater/CH\n                    3\n                    OH. These findings establish conjugation‐controlled ion response as a key design principle for charge separation in saline photocatalysis and provide general guidelines for environment‐adaptive catalysts.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7279758?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化产氢","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究构建了具有局域共轭(DHP-COF)和扩展共轭(DHPD-COF)的一维共价有机框架，展示共轭控制的离子响应通过离子诱导极化调控电荷分离，用于海水光催化。在天然海水中，DHP-COF产氢速率达246.9 mmol g⁻¹ h⁻¹，是纯水中(49.1 mmol g⁻¹ h⁻¹)的5.03倍。","kp":["一维共价有机框架[海水光催化产氢]: 通过共轭控制离子响应实现离子诱导极化调控电荷分离"]},{"t":"等离子体S型异质结实现光辅助Li─O2电池的宽带响应和超低过电势","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Li─O\n                    2\n                    batteries (LOBs) offer an ultrahigh theoretical energy density but suffer from a large overpotential. Photocathodes can lower this overpotential, but most of them cannot achieve efficient charge separation, sufficient redox capability, and broadband photoresponse at the same time. Here, a plasmonic S‐scheme heterojunction photocathode (W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    49\n                    /\n                    g\n                    ‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    , WOCN) is constructed. W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    49\n                    serves as the oxidation semiconductor of the heterojunction and a noble‐metal‐free plasmonic absorber, forming a continuous plasmonic heterointerface with\n                    g\n                    ‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    . The intrinsic localized surface plasmon resonance (LSPR) of W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    49\n                    originates from periodically arranged lattice‐localized electrons in W\n                    5+\n                    clusters. Photogenerated carriers with strong redox capability and LSPR‐generated hot electrons are separated by the S‐scheme carrier transfer pathway. Under AM 1.5G illumination, the WOCN‐based LOBs exhibit an ultralow overpotential of 0.04 V and a round‐trip efficiency of 98.75%. Even under NIR illumination, an overpotential of 0.34 V and a round‐trip efficiency of 90.12% are achieved, demonstrating an effective NIR response in photo‐assisted LOBs for the first time. This work opens a new avenue for designing plasmonic S‐scheme heterojunctions toward next‐generation energy storage systems with full solar spectrum utilization.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2006350?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂氧电池","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对Li-O2电池过电势大、多数光阴极难以同时实现高效电荷分离、足够氧化还原能力和宽带光响应的问题，研究构建了等离子体S型异质结光阴极W18O49/g-C3N4(WOCN)，其中W18O49作为氧化半导体，实现光辅助Li-O2电池的宽带响应和超低过电势。","kp":["Li-O2电池[等离子体S型异质结光电阴极]: W18O49基，实现宽带光响应与超低过电势"]},{"t":"ALDH 抑制引发的光催化破坏癌症干性可塑性","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Light‐driven photoredox catalysis can shift intracellular NADH/NAD\n                    +\n                    balance by oxidizing NADH, but intracellular NADH pools are dynamically replenished through enzyme‐coupled redox metabolism. We show that ALDH‐mediated restoration of NADH/NAD\n                    +\n                    balance can buffer photoredox‐induced NADH depletion, providing a design rationale for coupling enzyme inhibition with photoredox catalysis. To counteract this redox‐buffering process, we introduce an enzymatic–photocatalytic strategy, termed E–PC, that integrates ALDH inhibition with NIR‐driven photocatalytic NADH oxidation within a single molecular construct. A small‐molecule conjugate,\n                    DE‐Et\n                    , was constructed by covalently linking DEAB, which can inhibit ALDH, to a near‐infrared (NIR)–active Nile Blue Sulfide–derived photocatalyst (NBS) through a ROS‐cleavable thioacetal linker. Upon NIR irradiation,\n                    DE‐Et\n                    releases DEAB while catalytically oxidizing intracellular NADH through single‐electron transfer, thereby attenuating ALDH‐mediated redox restoration and sustaining NADH/NAD\n                    +\n                    imbalance. This dual action compromises mitochondrial ATP production and activates caspase‐3/GSDME‐dependent pyroptosis. In stemness‐enriched tumor models,\n                    DE‐Et\n                    suppresses ALDH activity, clonogenic growth, spheroid integrity, and tumor growth in vivo. Local photoactivation further promotes systemic antitumor immune responses, consistent with immunogenic pyroptotic cell death. E–PC thus establishes a chemical strategy for light‐activated co‐delivery of photoredox catalysis and inhibition of a tumor‐overexpressed enzyme, converting an adaptive enzymatic buffer into a therapeutic vulnerability.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5856873?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化抗癌","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究发现ALDH酶介导的NADH/NAD+平衡恢复可缓冲光氧化还原催化引起的胞内NADH损耗，据此提出酶-光催化(E-PC)策略，将ALDH抑制与近红外驱动的光催化NADH氧化整合于单一分子构建中，通过小分子偶联物DE-Et破坏癌细胞干性可塑性，为酶抑制与光催化耦合提供设计依据。","kp":["光催化抗癌策略[癌症干性破坏]: ALDH酶抑制耦合光氧化还原催化，阻断NADH/NAD+平衡的酶促恢复"]},{"t":"环丁烷β-氨基醇的模块化和立体选择性合成","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cyclobutane\n                    β\n                    ‐amino alcohols are valuable structural motifs, yet their development has lagged behind that of five‐ and six‐membered analogs due to limited synthetic accessibility. In this work, we report a general and modular strategy for the synthesis of diversely substituted cyclobutane\n                    β\n                    ‐amino alcohols. The electronic structure of 1,2‐azaborines is leveraged to achieve regioselective mono‐ and difunctionalization at all four carbon positions. The installed functionalities are subsequently translated into cyclobutane\n                    β\n                    ‐amino alcohol frameworks through a tandem photoisomerization–hydrogenation–oxidation sequence. This strategy provides access to eight distinct substitution patterns with high levels of modularity and diastereoselectivity.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1530338?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"环丁烷合成","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究报道了一种通用、模块化的环丁烷β-氨基醇合成策略：利用1,2-氮硼烷的电子结构实现全部四个碳位点的区域选择性单/双官能化，随后通过光异构化-加氢-氧化串联序列将官能团转化为环丁烷β-氨基醇骨架，实现多样化取代的立体选择性合成，弥补四元环类似物合成方法滞后于五、六元环类似物的不足。","kp":["环丁烷β-氨基醇[立体选择性合成]: 利用1,2-氮硼杂环的电子结构实现模块化、立体选择性合成策略"]},{"t":"用于高盐度离子热电材料的富羰基非离子共价有机框架纳米通道","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐salinity electrolytes coupled with low‐grade heat offer an attractive opportunity for ionic thermoelectric conversion, yet conventional fixed‐charge membranes rapidly lose ion permselectivity in concentrated media because Donnan exclusion is strongly screened. Here, we report an isoreticular series of nonionic covalent organic framework membranes with comparable one‐dimensional nanochannels but systematically varied pore‐wall oxygen chemistry. Hydroxyl‐substitution‐regulated hydrazone‐to‐β‐ketoenamine tautomerism generates carbonyl‐enriched BthTb‐3OH nanochannels, which preferentially partition and transport cations while suppressing anion migration without relying on covalently anchored charges. Across diverse electrolytes, BthTb‐3OH exhibits broadly cation‐favored transport, with particularly strong cation/anion mobility contrasts in sulfate‐ and phosphate‐containing media. Experiments and molecular dynamics simulations further reveal that the carbonyl‐rich channels couple high K\n                    +\n                    permselectivity with rapid K\n                    +\n                    conduction under concentrated‐salt conditions. K\n                    3\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    preconditioning reorganizes the confined transport landscape through retained phosphate/K\n                    +\n                    species within the carbonyl‐rich nanochannels, facilitating K\n                    +\n                    transport and amplifying thermodiffusive cation/anion contrast in sulfate media. Consequently, the conditioned membrane delivers a peak power density of 224.2 W m\n                    −2\n                    in saturated K\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    under a 50 K temperature difference, establishing nonionic COF nanochannels as a charge‐screening‐resistant platform for high‐salinity ionic thermoelectrics.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4046032?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子热电","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对高盐度下固定电荷膜因Donnan排斥被强屏蔽而迅速丧失离子选择性的问题，研究报道一系列具有可比一维纳米通道但孔壁氧化学系统变化的非离子共价有机框架膜。羟基取代调控的腙-β-酮烯胺互变异构生成富羰基的BthTb-3OH纳米通道，无需共价锚定电荷即可优先分配和传输阳离子并抑制阴离子迁移，适用于高盐度离子热电转换。","kp":["膜材料[高盐度离子热电转换]: 非离子共价有机框架膜","失效机制[传统固定电荷膜在高盐电解质]: Donnan排斥被强屏蔽导致离子选择性快速丧失"]},{"t":"正交光化学限制结晶可实现机械稳健、可打印的形状可编程聚合物","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Shape‐programmable polymers are promising for soft robotics, minimally invasive medicine, and deployable structures. However, integrating high mechanical robustness, versatile shape programmability, and excellent printability into a single material system remains challenging. Here, an orthogonal photochemistry‐confined crystallization strategy is developed to fabricate mechanically robust, printable shape‐programmable polymers. This approach utilizes a rationally designed photochemical process to trigger radical polymerization and phenol coupling synchronously yet orthogonally, enabling one‐step formation of a covalent double‐network that efficiently confines polymer crystallization during solvent evaporation. The resulting homogeneous, refined crystalline domains greatly enhance stretchability (1891%) and toughness (41 MJ m\n                    −\n                    3\n                    ) by up to 63‐ and 103‐fold, respectively, compared to counterparts lacking network confinement, while also maintaining fatigue resistance over 1500 stretching cycles. The synergy between confined crystallization and double‐network confinement further confers shape reconfiguration and shape‑memory morphing, affording robust shape programmability under thermal stimuli. Moreover, the efficient photo‑mediated gelation, coupled with solvent evaporation, enables rapid and controllable solidification fully compatible with additive manufacturing. Leveraging these capabilities, and as a proof‐of‐concept, the developed polymers are printed and assembled into bioinspired soft actuators capable of integrated active actuation and precise sensing. This work provides new insight into the photochemical design of high‐performance shape‐programmable polymers and advanced soft devices.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7052006?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"形状编程聚合物","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发正交光化学限制结晶策略，制备机械稳健、可打印的形状可编程聚合物：合理设计的光化学过程同步且正交地触发自由基聚合与酚偶联，一步形成共价双网络，在溶剂蒸发过程中有效限制聚合物结晶。所得均匀、细化的材料兼具高机械强度、多样形状可编程性和优异打印性，适用于软机器人、微创医学和可展开结构。","kp":["制造策略[形状可编程聚合物]: 正交光化学限制结晶","材料特性[形状可编程聚合物]: 机械稳健、可打印、形状可编程一体化"]},{"t":"LOXL2 在单链与三螺旋中的赖氨酸氧化：对胶原相关疾病的影响","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Collagen cross‐linking is essential for the structural integrity of the extracellular matrix. In several pathological conditions, the triple‐helical core of collagen is disrupted, and proline‐rich single strands occur. Lysyl oxidases (LOXs), enzymes that initiate cross‐linking by catalyzing the oxidative deamination of lysine to allysine residues, are upregulated in disease. Surprisingly little is known about the selectivity of LOXs. LOX‐initiated cross‐linking is believed to occur exclusively in the unstructured terminal domains of collagen, the telopeptides. But is this really the case? Herein, we show, with a combination of tailored chemical probes, enzymatic assays, CD and NMR spectroscopic analyses, that LOXL2 oxidizes Lys in proline‐rich single strands but not in triple helices. A comparison of Lys‐containing collagen model peptides (CMPs) with Lys‐containing telopeptides revealed comparable or higher oxidation rates in proline‐rich segments. The data suggest that LOXL2‐initiated cross‐linking occurs in pathologically disrupted triple‐helical domains, offering insights into aberrant extracellular matrix stiffening.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1329257?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"胶原氧化交联","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"赖氨酰氧化酶(LOXs)通过催化赖氨酸氧化脱氨为醛赖氨酸起始胶原交联，通常认为LOX引发的交联仅发生在胶原端肽的非结构化末端区域。研究利用定制化学探针、酶学测定、圆二色和NMR光谱分析表明，LOXL2可在富含脯氨酸的单链中氧化赖氨酸，而在三螺旋中不行，对胶原相关疾病中三螺旋核心破坏后富含脯氨酸单链出现的病理状况具有重要意义。","kp":["催化反应[赖氨酰氧化酶]: 催化赖氨酸氧化脱氨生成醛赖氨酸残基","酶活性[胶原相关疾病]: LOX上调表达"]},{"t":"通过氧氧化还原活化构建耐用 O3 型层状过渡金属氧化物的应变缓冲层状/岩盐异质结构","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Harnessing anionic oxygen redox is pivotal for boosting the capacity of O3‐type layered transition metal oxides for sodium ion batteries (SIBs), yet it often triggers severe lattice distortion and irreversible oxygen release. Herein, we propose an in situ electrochemical surface reconstruction strategy to stabilize the O3‐type NaNi\n                    1/3\n                    Fe\n                    1/3\n                    Mn\n                    1/3\n                    O\n                    2\n                    (NFM) cathode. By strictly controlling the initial anionic redox reactions at an ultra‐high potential of 4.6 V, a robust heterostructure comprising an ordered layered core and a disordered rocksalt shell is constructed. This unique surface architecture serves as an isotropic strain buffer that effectively mitigates particle cracking and provides dense surface passivation to suppress interfacial side reactions. Furthermore, the induced rocksalt phase stabilizes the surface TM‐O coordination, thereby preventing lattice oxygen loss during subsequent cycling. Consequently, when cycled within 2.0–4.0 V, the electrochemically pretreated cathode (DRS(4.6)@NFM) exhibits significantly reduced lattice distortion and superior electrochemical durability (capacity retention ratio of 90.77% after 300 cycles) with negligible voltage decay (retaining 98.56% of the initial voltage). Even when cycled up to 4.2 V, a capacity retention ratio of 87.4% after 300 cycles is still maintained. This work elucidates the interplay between electrochemical pretreatment and structural evolution, providing a decisive foundation for designing high‐voltage and durable sodium‐ion cathodes.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7544135?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电正极材料","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"aip":1,"as":"钠离子电池O3型层状氧化物正极利用阴离子氧氧化还原可提升容量，但会引发严重晶格畸变和不可逆氧释放。该研究提出原位电化学表面重构策略稳定O3型NaNi1/3Fe1/3Mn1/3O2正极：在4.6V超高电位下严格控制初始阴离子氧化还原反应，构建由有序层状核心和无序岩盐壳层组成的稳健异质结构，以此缓解结构退化，提升材料耐用性。","kp":["电极材料[钠离子电池]: O3型NaNi1/3Fe1/3Mn1/3层状过渡金属氧化物","稳定化策略[抑制氧氧化还原所致晶格畸变与氧释放]: 原位电化学表面重构构建层状/岩盐异质结构应变缓冲层","容量提升机制[O3型层状氧化物]: 阴离子氧氧化还原活化"]},{"t":"通过腈捕获的异铬烯鎓中间体和 CO-to-CN 开关合成异喹啉","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Isochromenylium ions have emerged as versatile intermediates for the rapid construction of molecular complexity through cascade reactions. However, their application in catalytic annulation processes with nitriles to form isoquinolines remains largely unexplored, despite the prevalence of nitrile motifs and isoquinoline frameworks in bioactive molecules and functional materials. Here we report a catalytic cascade strategy for the efficient synthesis of isoquinolines, including enantioenriched variants, from readily available substrates. The reaction includes palladium‐catalyzed cyclization of\n                    ortho‐\n                    alkynylaryl aldehydes to generate an isochromenylium palladium species, which is captured by indium‐promoted 1,2‐addition of nitriles. Subsequent water‐assisted ring opening furnishes a Zincke‐type intermediate, followed by intramolecular condensation to deliver the isoquinoline products. This cascade process achieves a net conversion of a carbonyl (CO) unit into a nitrile‐derived carbon‐nitrogen (CN) linkage at an intermediate‐stage in a single operation. Notably, the use of malononitrile‐tethered substrates enables the synthesis of enantioenriched isoquinolines with high enantioselectivity. Mechanistic studies indicate a cooperative role of palladium and indium in promoting the 1,2‐addition of isochromenylium palladium species to the nitrile. The method exhibits excellent atom economy, good functional group tolerance, and scalability, highlighting its potential application for heterocycle synthesis.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5898322?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"异喹啉合成","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"异铬烯鎓离子是通过级联反应快速构建分子复杂性的多功能中间体，但其与腈的催化成环形成异喹啉的应用尚未被充分探索。该研究报道了一种催化级联策略，从易得底物高效合成异喹啉（包括对映富集产物）：钯催化邻炔基芳基醛环化生成异铬烯鎓钯物种，随后被铟促进的腈捕获，经CO-to-CN开关过程实现成环，为生物活性分子和功能材料中的异喹啉骨架合成提供新途径。","kp":["合成策略[异喹啉]: 催化级联反应经异铬烯鎓中间体腈捕获及CO-to-CN开关"]},{"t":"用于纳米颗粒和表面可见光功能化的 TADF 活性四唑发光体","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) materials have found broad use in technologies spanning displays, bioimaging, and photocatalysis. In parallel, tetrazoles have become powerful “click” reagents for light‐activated, bioorthogonal ligations, yet remain unexplored in reagents with delayed emission lifetimes. Here we report the design and synthesis of TADF‐active tetrazole luminophores with photochemical reactivity for the rapid functionalization of nanoparticles and surfaces. The combination of electron‐rich phenoxazine donors with electron‐deficient tetrazole acceptors yields luminophores with bright emission and tunable TADF lifetimes, governed by the 1,3‐dipolar cycloaddition partner. Cycloaddition with alkene dipolarophiles affords saturated dihydropyrazoles that undergo photoinduced aerobic aromatization to generate pyrazole products exhibiting pronounced turn‐on TADF behavior. Leveraging their charge‐transfer character, we also demonstrate a gold surface modified with TADF luminophores, wherein we propose the first example of reversible visible light‐induced surface adsorption. Furthermore, we demonstrate the surface functionalization of organic nanoparticles using TADF‐active materials. This work introduces a class of functional materials that combine photochemical reactivity with TADF properties, introducing a light‐driven platform for surface functionalization using TADF materials.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9410589?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"TADF发光材料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"热激活延迟荧光（TADF）材料广泛用于显示、生物成像和光催化，而四唑是光激活生物正交连接的强力点击试剂，但在延迟发射寿命试剂中尚未被探索。该研究设计合成了具有光化学反应活性的TADF四唑发光体，可快速功能化纳米颗粒和表面。富电子吩噁嗪给体与缺电子四唑受体的组合产生明亮发射和可调TADF寿命，寿命由1,3-偶极环加成 partner 决定，与烯烃双极亲核体环加合可得到饱和产物。","kp":["发光材料[纳米颗粒和表面可见光功能化]: TADF活性四唑发光体","功能特性[四唑发光体]: 延迟发射寿命与光化学反应性兼具"]},{"t":"单分子分辨率鉴定衰老相关 β-半乳糖苷酶","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The majority of human senescent cells exhibit overexpression of senescence‐associated β‐galactosidase (SA‐β‐gal), rendering this enzyme the most extensively utilized biomarker of senescence and a key prodrug target for intervening in aging. However, strategies for the authentic in situ identification of SA‐β‐gal with single‐molecule resolution have not been established, limiting the accuracy of senescence targeting. Here we present an unprecedented molecular approach to identify SA‐β‐gal in a manner that avoids dissociation from the target enzyme, which integrates the atomic hybridization of SA‐β‐gal substrates with protein‐environment‐sensitive fluorescence technology. Using this design principle, we created nine fluorescent probes with distinct working modes for the single‐molecule (target enzyme)‐resolved identification of SA‐β‐gal. Five of them formed crystal complexes with the wild‐type β‐galactosidase by binding at the active site, clearly evidencing their single‐molecule resolution capability. Our strategy, capable of both identifying and locating SA‐β‐gal, facilitated its application in dynamic single‐molecule localization microscopic imaging, achieving the in situ tracking of SA‐β‐gal in living cells at the nanoscale. Significantly, the probing of SA‐β‐gal with high fidelity enabled the precise evaluation of the aging degree in mice. As such, our research provides a promising method for the authentic in situ identification of this senescence‐associated protein with single‐molecule resolution.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5443283?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单分子酶检测","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"as":"大多数人类衰老细胞过表达衰老相关β-半乳糖苷酶（SA-β-gal），该酶是最广泛使用的衰老生物标志物和干预衰老的前药靶点。但此前缺乏单分子分辨率的真实原位鉴定SA-β-gal的策略，限制了衰老靶向的准确性。该研究提出分子方法，将SA-β-gal底物的原子杂化与蛋白质环境敏感荧光技术相结合，实现不与靶酶解离的鉴定，并据此创建了九种具有不同工作模式的荧光探针。","kp":["检测目标[衰老细胞]: 衰老相关β-半乳糖苷酶（SA-β-gal）为最广泛使用的衰老生物标志物","技术突破[SA-β-gal检测]: 实现单分子分辨率的原位鉴定"]},{"t":"用于圆形 3D 打印的可见光介导的光点击和热可逆呋喃二硫缩醛化学","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Photoclick chemistry has become essential for photocurable 3D printing due to its rapid, selective, and spatiotemporally controlled bond formation. Advancing toward circular manufacturing, however, requires photoclick systems that also enable thermally reversible bond cleavage for material recycling. To meet this requirement, we report a furanic dithioacetal‐based photoclick platform that integrates visible‐light‐induced polymerization with intrinsic thermal reversibility. The monomers, derived from bio‐based furanic aldehydes and thiols, are solvent‐free liquids, ensuring homogeneous formulations well‐suited for 3D printing. To address the spectral mismatch of conventional photocatalysts, a thioxanthone‐based photoacid system is investigated, enabling efficient bond formation under visible light compatible with commercial digital light processing (DLP) printing. The resulting polymer networks exhibit tunable crosslinking densities, allowing precise control over mechanical properties. Crucially, the dynamic furanic dithioacetal linkages enable depolymerization of the printed materials into re‐printable oligomers, with no loss of performance over multiple recycling cycles. This work establishes a chemically integrated strategy that unifies visible‐light processability, solvent‐free formulation, bio‐based origin, and closed‐loop recyclability, thus establishing a robust foundation for circular photopolymer platforms.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3093462?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光固化3D打印","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"光点击化学因快速、选择性、时空可控的成键而成为光固化3D打印的核心，但实现循环制造还需要热可逆断键以回收材料。该研究报道基于呋喃二硫缩醛的光点击平台，集可见光诱导聚合与固有热可逆性于一体。单体源自生物基呋喃醛和硫醇，为无溶剂液体，保证配方均质适用于3D打印。针对传统光催化剂的光谱失配问题，研究了基于噻吨酮的光酸体系以实现高效聚合。","kp":["材料体系[圆形3D打印]: 呋喃二硫缩醛光点击平台","功能特性[该光点击体系]: 可见光诱导聚合与内在热可逆性结合，实现材料回收"]},{"t":"软刚性液态金属-SiC混合填料可实现复合电介质的优异非线性电导率和电场调节","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nonlinear dielectrics with superior electric field regulation capabilities are essential for advanced power equipment. However, traditional nonlinear dielectric materials depend on an electrical percolation mechanism, requiring high concentrations of nonlinear conductive filler that degrade insulation and mechanical properties. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy using a hybrid filler of soft liquid metal and rigid silicon carbide particles (LM‐SiCp) to develop insulating nonlinear composite dielectrics. The unique LM‐SiCp structure enables a favorable network of potential barriers at low fields and steep exponential current growth at high fields, yielding an excellent “low onset, high gain” nonlinear behavior. The resulting composites exhibit an impressive nonlinear coefficient of ∼7.55 and a markedly reduced threshold field strength from 4.81 to 3.41 kV/mm. It also achieves improved toughness (2.29 MJ/m\n                    3\n                    ), thermal conductivity (0.36 W/mK), high breakdown strength (∼33.4 kV/mm), and low dielectric loss (&lt;0.03), which ensure the stable performance of the composite dielectric under practical engineering conditions. This strategy offers a novel design concept for high‐performance composite dielectrics capable of effective electric field modulation in power equipment.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74306?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非线性电介质","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"先进电力设备需要具有优异电场调节能力的非线性电介质，但传统材料依赖电渗流机制，需高浓度非线性导电填料，损害绝缘和机械性能。该研究提出软性液态金属与刚性碳化硅颗粒（LM-SiCp）混合填料的协同策略：独特的LM-SiCp结构在低场下形成有利势垒网络，高场下产生陡峭指数电流增长，实现'低起始、高增益'的非线性行为，开发出绝缘性非线性复合电介质。","kp":["复合填料[非线性电介质]: 软性液态金属与刚性碳化硅混合填料","传统缺陷[传统非线性电介质]: 依赖电渗透机制需高浓度非线性导电填料，损害绝缘与机械性能"]},{"t":"原位衍生的 La​​-Ni 基钙钛矿上的叶绿体模拟界面，用于太阳能驱动的 CO2 还原为 CH4","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Artificial photosynthesis technology holds great promise for sustainable energy conversion and value‐added chemical synthesis, yet integrating efficient light absorption with high product selectivity remains a major challenge. This study constructs an Ni‐La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    catalyst through in situ perovskite derivation that mechanistically and functionally mimics the chloroplast for artificial photosynthesis by coupling photo and photothermal catalysis with the integration of broad‐spectrum light harvesting, directional charge transfer, as well as CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and hydrogenation. Three functional interfaces are formed: La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ‐La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    (Z‐scheme), Ni‐La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    (Schottky junction), and La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    (adsorption)‐Ni(activation). The two heterojunctions facilitate electron transfer to metallic Ni nanoparticles, which activates H\n                    +\n                    to form an NADPH‐like surface Ni‐H species by enabling the collection of photo and photothermal generated electrons. Meanwhile, the Lewis‐basic La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    captures CO\n                    2\n                    and promotes its activation at the La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ‐Ni interface. In CO\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐CH\n                    4\n                    conversion, Ni‐La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    demonstrates an exceptional CH\n                    4\n                    production rate of 9.96 µmol h\n                    −1\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    and a selectivity of 92.5% under natural conditions (i.e., AM 1.5 irradiation, ambient temperature, and atmospheric pressure) without external assistance, which outperforms pure La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    by 10.2 and 4.6 times, respectively. This work advances a new strategy for efficient solar‐to‐fuel conversion.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74829?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化还原","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"人工光合技术在可持续能源转换和高附加值化学品合成方面前景广阔，但将高效光吸收与高产物选择性结合仍是重大挑战。该研究通过钙钛矿原位衍生构建Ni-La2O3/La2NiO4催化剂，从机制和功能上模拟叶绿体：耦合光催化与光热催化，集成宽谱光吸收、定向电荷转移以及CO2活化，实现太阳能驱动CO2还原为CH4。","kp":["催化剂[太阳能驱动CO2还原制CH4]: Ni-La2O3/La2NiO4原位衍生La-Ni基钙钛矿","设计理念[该催化剂]: 叶绿体模拟界面集成高效光吸收与高产物选择性"]},{"t":"活性聚合物软物质的自主折叠","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Origami provides a versatile framework for shape‐morphing, yet existing systems are limited to transitions between an initial state and a predetermined folding outcome, offering little tunability after fabrication. Here we introduce a dynamic “living” polymer that continuously remodels its main‐chain network through a growth process, enabling post‐fabrication control over size, mechanical properties, and geometry. Incorporated as active crease layers, these polymers drive autonomous folding when supplied with “nutrient solutions” containing monomers, crosslinkers and catalysts. The associated dihedral angles are determined by growth kinetics and crease composition. Iterative regrowth reprograms folding pathways and increases mechanical stiffness up to 50 times. We demonstrate rigid (Miura) and non‐rigid patterns (square‐twist) that can be repeatedly reconfigured. Through this work, we establish a foundation for adaptive structures with unlimited re‐programmability, opening avenues for applications in biomedical wearable devices and multifunctional deployable systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74348?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"活性聚合物折叠","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"as":"现有折纸形变系统仅限于初始状态与预定折叠结果之间的转变，制成后可调性有限。该研究引入动态'活性'聚合物，通过生长过程持续重塑主链网络，实现制造后对尺寸、机械性能和几何形状的控制。作为活性折痕层，这些聚合物在供给含单体、交联剂和催化剂的'营养液'后驱动自主折叠，二面角由生长动力学和折痕组成决定。迭代再生可重编程折叠路径，并将机械刚度提高至50倍。","kp":["活性聚合物[自主折叠软物质]: 通过生长过程持续重塑主链网络，实现制造后对尺寸、力学性能和几何形状的调控"]},{"t":"通过操纵尖晶石四面体和八面体位点活性来切换过一硫酸盐氧化还原路线，用于多场景废水处理","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    For diverse wastewater treatment scenarios, achieving controllable switching of reactive oxygen species within a unified catalytic system remains a major challenge. Here, an inert cation substitution strategy is proposed to regulate tetrahedral and octahedral Co activity in Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , enabling controllable switching between radical and nonradical pathways. Octahedral‐Co‐enriched ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (ZCO) selectively directs peroxymonosulfate (PMS) activation toward the\n                    1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    pathway (95.8% contribution), whereas tetrahedral‐Co‐dominated CoAl\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (CAO) favors radical oxidation, with •OH (76.4%) and SO\n                    4\n                    •−\n                    (21.7%) dominating. This polyhedral‐dependent pathway control leads to distinct oxidation behaviors. Notably, the ZCO/PMS system achieved nearly 100% o‐nitrophenol (ONP) degradation within 4 min, with a\n                    k\n                    ‐value of 71.81 min\n                    −1\n                    M\n                    −1\n                    , 32.2 times that of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    . Multiple lines of evidence reveal that polyhedral‐site engineering governs PMS adsorption geometry, interfacial charge redistribution, and O─O bond activation, thereby determining pathway selection. These differentiated functions were further translated into bench‐scale municipal wastewater treatment, with ZCO/PMS increasing the effluent Biochemical oxygen demand/chemical oxygen demand (BOD/COD) ratio from below 0.3 to consistently above 0.5 over 80 h and CAO/PMS decreasing the effluent TOC from ∼25 mg L\n                    −1\n                    to below 12 mg L\n                    −1\n                    over 60 h. Both systems exhibited low biotoxicity and favorable sustainability, offering a practical route toward selective energy‐efficient advanced oxidation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74854?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废水催化氧化","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"在多种废水处理场景下，统一催化体系中实现活性氧物种的可控切换是重大挑战。该研究提出惰性阳离子取代策略调控Co3O4中四面体和八面体Co活性，实现自由基与非自由基路径的可控切换：八面体Co富集的ZnCo2O4（ZCO）选择性引导过一硫酸盐（PMS）活化走向单线态氧（1O2）路径，贡献率达95.8%，而四面体Co则导向其他路径，适用于多场景废水处理。","kp":["催化路线切换[Co3O4尖晶石]: 通过惰性阳离子取代调控四面体与八面体Co位点活性，实现自由基与非自由基路径可控切换","应用场景[过一硫酸盐氧化]: 多场景废水处理"]},{"t":"用于脑肿瘤生物制剂输送的先进材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Brain cancer remains a major global health challenge due to its high morbidity and mortality. Current standard therapies are often limited by incomplete tumor resection, systemic toxicity, and the inability to effectively penetrate the blood‐brain barrier (BBB), which restricts drug delivery to the tumor site. These challenges underscore the urgent need for innovative therapeutic strategies that can overcome these barriers and improve treatment outcomes. Biological materials encompass a diverse range of molecules, from small peptides to monoclonal antibodies, either derived from living organisms or synthetically synthesized. Unlike traditional therapies, biologics provide a more targeted approach, including specific tumor targeting, immune system modulation, and regenerating damaged cells. Although biologics offer significant promise for brain cancer treatment, major challenges associated with blood–brain and tumour barriers continue to limit their translation, and comprehensive reviews bridging therapeutic advances with delivery technologies remain scarce. While individual biologic classes have been extensively studied, a unified assessment of these modalities and their delivery optimization is still needed. This review addresses the current gap by critically examining recent advances in biologic therapies and evaluating emerging invasive and non‐invasive delivery strategies to enhance their therapeutic efficacy in brain cancer.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74760?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"脑药递材料","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"脑癌因高发病率和高死亡率仍是全球重大健康挑战。现有标准疗法常受限于肿瘤切除不完全、全身毒性以及无法有效穿透血脑屏障（BBB），导致药物难以到达肿瘤部位。生物制剂涵盖从小分子肽到单克隆抗体的多种分子，可源自生物体或化学合成。与传统疗法不同，生物制剂提供更具针对性的策略，包括特异性肿瘤靶向、免疫系统调节等，为克服上述屏障、改善治疗效果提供了创新途径。","kp":["递送挑战[脑肿瘤生物制剂]: 血脑屏障限制药物输送至肿瘤部位，现有疗法受限于切除不完全和全身毒性"]}]);